  is gone and the item count reads 8 for 9. The replay stops there (`uncarry-d3-70e4-v22/`).
- `judge_probe.py check … --case 3 v22 2026-07-06 76 e176` passes: the control is the saved request and what the code builds today;
  the two requests differ only by that block and the count; the frozen check accepts the saved answer on the control and refuses it
  on the other.

## The send

v22's request of 2026-07-06 as saved and without the carried record, three times each, interleaved, through the production
transport and the spending limit, with the sender reviewed on 2026-11-10 (`step2-edge-effect-2026-11-10/PROTOCOL.md`, "Reviews before
